cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Geometric Reflexive Coherence"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Jovanovič"
    given-names: "Uroš"
abstract: >-
  Geometric Reflexive Coherence is a papers-first research archive about
  self-defined, self-referential dynamical systems in which a coherence field
  induces geometry, geometry shapes flux, and flux updates the field. The
  repository develops the formal theory, continuum and graph substrates,
  investigations, observations, and interpretive and engineering extensions
  concerning identity, agency, participation, formation, scale, and ecology.
keywords:
  - reflexive coherence
  - dynamical systems
  - complex systems
  - artificial life
  - self-organization
  - agentic ecology
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
